 \nNon ci torno dal 2018, il mio primo viaggio con Romi, la nostra luna di miele in cui abbiamo sperimentato il colpo del re: vomitare e cacare contemporaneamente e nello stesso bagno per un’intossicazione alimentare che non dimeticherò mai. \nSpero in nuovo finale per questo Vietnam 2023.", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gE3TqPh57HY6ln5cZDlOwgpQtCetXcOSO6s_97aNIbDPov2U5XwIhSbqDSK5KmaXps&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEy0YwI&_nc_gid=B2oBVGGlv_mWKFyEhdNSbw&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af9WbsP147nbAlr4petp1RqAhkW4AfclO3gnxhSDdVml8g&oe=6A266AEC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "Saying goodbye to Bangkok today for Hanoi.\nI haven’t been back since 2018, my first trip with Romi, our honeymoon where we experienced King’s Blow: vomiting and shitting at the same time and in the same bathroom for food poisoning that I will never quit.\nHope for new ending for this Vietnam 2023."}, "comment_count": 84, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "feed_post_reshare_disabled": false, "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "third_party_downloads_enabled": 2, "eligible_for_text_app_activation_badge": false, "account_type": 3, "can_see_quiet_post_attribution": true, "account_badges": [], "f